0, Electrical +15, Mechanical +15, Medical +10, Military +10, Pilot +15, Pilot Related +10, Science +15, Technical +10; Domestic, Rogue, W.P. and Wilderness any; Physical any except Acrobatics; Espionage none, so the category is omitted. SECONDARY: two at each of levels 1, 4, 8 and 12, same limits without the bonuses. || EQUIPMENT: an energy weapon of choice from a catalog set, 1D4 spare E-clips, hand computer (hand-held-computer), camera (digital-camera), flashlight, tool kit, first-aid kit. || MONEY: 3D6x100 in credits, stored; the 2D4x1000 in salable mechanical devices is goods rather than coin and is recorded here."
